fter the cast step's gerrit-review-action is removed this becomes 0","The plan enumerates only three replacement properties (consumes normalize output, before triage step, sparse-checkout) and does not name the one-cast invariant assertion"],"finding":"The plan under-enumerates which assertions in the named test file must be rewritten: test_only_one_step_casts_a_vote asserts exactly one gerrit-review-action `uses:` exists in the vote job, which becomes zero once the cast step is replaced, so it will fail unless also rewritten.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f17e318a19773463a","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan 'Test impact' paragraph; tests/unit/test_gerrit_verify_triage_comment.py lines 72-75","norm_id":"nae77adf62c513346","priority":0.8889,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Author rewrites only the vote-type/ordering pins; test_only_one_step_casts_a_vote still runs and fails because no gerrit-review-action `uses:` remains in the vote job"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"State that test_only_one_step_casts_a_vote must be re-pinned to assert exactly one invocation of the new scripts/cast_gerrit_verified_vote.py helper step (and zero remaining gerrit-review-action `uses:` in the vote job).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"omits_required_site","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Record the new 'Gerrit change-is-closed => successful noop' disposition in ADR 0023 (or a linked ADR/doc) so the new inbound-vote contract is documented alongside the existing +1/-1 mapping.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["T7","T5e"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":0.05,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan cites 'ADR 0023 defines the inbound path as SSH `gerrit review` setting `Verified +1` for success or `Verified -1` for failed/cancelled' — ADR describes only +1/-1, not a closed-change noop","'print an Actions notice naming the change/patchset and exit 0 because the change has already moved to a terminal unvoteable state' is a new disposition not captured in any named doc","No acceptance criterion or step updates ADR 0023 / AGENTS.md to record the new closed-change contract"],"finding":"The plan introduces a new behavioral contract — a Gerrit 'change is closed' response is now treated as a successful noop (exit 0) rather than a failed vote — but does not update ADR 0023 (which it cites as defining the inbound Verified +1/-1 path) or any doc to record this new terminal-disposition branch.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f02ff0f805544817e","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan / Root cause / classification bullets; ADR 0023 reference","norm_id":"n12f53856dd41e4df","priority":1.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future maintainer reads ADR 0023 to understand the Verified gate and is unaware that closed changes now silently succeed","A later change re-tightens closed-change handling without knowing it was a deliberate design decision"],"severit